---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="" description="台中希望教會｜讓愛天天住你家，台中南區基督教教會">

  <!-- Hero — 文字在上，全寬橫版照片在下 -->
  <section class="bg-white">

    <!-- 文字區 -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-20 pb-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">

        <!-- 左欄：小標籤 + 大標題 + 描述 + CTA -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div class="w-8 h-px bg-hope-green"></div>
            <span class="text-hope-green text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">17 Go Hope Church</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-5">
            讓愛<br />
            天天<span class="text-hope-green">住</span>你家
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            台中希望教會——一個活力、歡樂的大家庭。<br />
            在這裡彼此相愛、相互扶持，一起經歷上帝的帶領與祝福。
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a href="/pastor/groups"
              class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-hope-green text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-hope-green-dark transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-green-200 text-center">
              加入小組
            </a>
            <a href="/about"
              class="px-8 py-3.5 border-2 border-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-semibold rounded-full hover:border-hope-green hover:text-hope-green transition-colors text-center">
              認識我們
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 右欄：HOPE 4力（排版風格） -->
        <div class="py-4">
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">生命影響力</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">活出你的影響力，讓希望真實可見</p>

          <div class="space-y-0">
            {[
              { letter: 'H', en: 'Honor God',     zh: '榮神益人', force: '神給力' },
              { letter: 'O', en: 'Open Hearts',   zh: '主動連結', force: '關係力' },
              { letter: 'P', en: 'Plant Faith',   zh: '教養傳承', force: '教養力' },
              { letter: 'E', en: 'Equip Leaders', zh: '裝備賦能', force: '領袖力' },
            ].map(({ letter, en, zh, force }) => (
              <div class="flex items-center gap-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0">
                <span class="text-4xl font-black text-hope-green w-10 flex-shrink-0 leading-none">{letter}</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">{en}</div>
                  <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5">{zh}</div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-hope-green font-bold text-base flex-shrink-0">{force}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 全寬照片區 -->
    <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-12">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <img
          src="/images/church-group.jpg"
          alt="台中希望教會大坑戶外崇拜大合照"
          class="w-full object-cover object-center"
          style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; max-height: 520px; width: 100%; object-fit: cover;"
        />
      </div>
      <!-- 地址小標籤 -->
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 px-1">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-hope-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
        </svg>
        <span>台中市南區工學北路169號　每週日主日崇拜</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- 三個入口 -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">你想從哪裡開始？</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">歡迎以任何方式認識我們</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

        <a href="/happiness" class="group p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 border border-transparent hover:border-hope-green">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-hope-green-light rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-hope-green transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-hope-green group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">幸福小聚</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">為還不認識信仰的新朋友而設，輕鬆聊聊，一起發現真正的幸福</p>
          <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-hope-green text-sm font-medium">
            了解更多
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/pastor/groups" class="group p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 border border-transparent hover:border-hope-green">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-hope-green-light rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-hope-green transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-hope-green group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">加入小組</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">各年齡層小組，找到屬於你的屬靈家人，一起成長</p>
          <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-hope-green text-sm font-medium">
            了解更多
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/pastor/messages" class="group p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 border border-transparent hover:border-hope-green">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-hope-green-light rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-hope-green transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-hope-green group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">主日信息</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">每週主日信息文字版，讓上帝的話語陪伴你一整週</p>
          <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-hope-green text-sm font-medium">
            了解更多
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOPE 4力專區 -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-hope-green-light text-hope-green text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
          希望教會生命影響力
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-widest">
          <span class="text-hope-green">H</span>OPE
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-xl mx-auto">希望教會不只是學習的地方，更是裝備每一個人的生命基地——讓你對家庭、職場、社會產生真實的正面影響力。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 mb-12">
        {[
          { letter: 'H', en: 'Honor God',     zh: '榮神益人', force: '神給力', desc: '一切以榮耀神為首要，讓我們所做的每一件事都成為榮耀祂名的見證。' },
          { letter: 'O', en: 'Open Hearts',   zh: '主動連結', force: '關係力', desc: '建立真實、深度的人際連結，讓愛的圈子不斷擴大，帶動更多人走向美好。' },
          { letter: 'P', en: 'Plant Faith',   zh: '教養傳承', force: '教養力', desc: '以聖經真理為根基，建造家庭與下一代，讓信仰的果實一代一代傳承下去。' },
          { letter: 'E', en: 'Equip Leaders', zh: '裝備賦能', force: '領袖力', desc: '培養看見可能、帶領他人的眼光與勇氣，讓你的生命成為周圍人的祝福與方向。' },
        ].map(({ letter, en, zh, force, desc }) => (
          <div class="group p-7 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-hope-green hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-hope-green-light group-hover:bg-hope-green rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center transition-colors flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-hope-green group-hover:text-white font-black text-2xl transition-colors">{letter}</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-hope-green font-bold text-sm bg-hope-green-light px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{force}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">{en}</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">{zh}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">{desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-700 mb-6">「活出你的影響力、讓希望真實可見」</p>
        <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border-2 border-hope-green text-hope-green font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-hope-green hover:text-white transition-colors">
          認識更多關於希望教會
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bible verse banner -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-hope-green">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <div class="w-10 h-px bg-green-300 mx-auto mb-8"></div>
      <blockquote class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-white leading-relaxed">
        「你們要聖潔，因為我耶和華你們的神是聖潔的。」
      </blockquote>
      <cite class="mt-5 block text-green-200 not-italic text-sm tracking-wide">利未記 19：2</cite>
      <div class="w-10 h-px bg-green-300 mx-auto mt-8"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 關於希望預覽 -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div class="w-8 h-px bg-hope-green"></div>
            <span class="text-hope-green text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">About Us</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5">關於台中希望教會</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            希望教會成立於 2012 年，由林志仁牧師與蔡鳳梅傳道帶領，是一個充滿活力與愛的基督教會。
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            我們相信每一個人都值得被愛、被接納。在這裡不分貧富、階級，一起在耶穌基督裡生根建造，讓信心增長、愛心增長、祝福增長。
          </p>
          <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-hope-green text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-hope-green-dark transition-colors">
            認識我們
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md">
          <img
            src="/images/church-community.jpg"
            alt="台中希望教會大家庭"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
